5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I want to ensure our reporting remains transparent and manageable. I'll look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I am interested in the actual drivers of our success. I will check the profile of the exits and the write-off, and account retention through price rises.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We must be mindful of our liquidity. I'll examine reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm worried about our bandwidth for hiring! I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand why our deployments lag. I'll investigate security review time before first deployment and delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
