25,2,1,talk,Servas,,It seems hardware and physical goods offer better verification but complicate our audits significantly. We should be cautious about adding more physical assets.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Our wins come from back-office financial tools. Interestingly, independent practices and field-based tools show much better retention than shopkeeper tools.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Our reserves are being depleted faster than planned. Furthermore, our credit line is useless for subscription-based security; it only favors stock.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mio,,"We are stretched thin on software boards, but we have logistics experts sitting idle. Also, finding field crews is a nightmare.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Security reviews for medical or financial data cause massive delays. Hardware is also prone to supply chain shocks that stall everything.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if the credit line doesn't support subscriptions, does that make software more or less risky for our current cash flow?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if medical data causes delays, we should avoid that sector regardless of the retention rates I saw.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, it makes software riskier for borrowing, but less demanding on immediate physical capital. However, the follow-on calls are already too high.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if we go with something logistics-heavy, we have the advisers, but the recruiters can't find the actual staff.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, that confirms my fear. Physical operations are a bottleneck for both delivery and staffing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Servas,,So we face a trade-off: software is easier to audit but harder to borrow against and slower to deploy if regulated.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"And physical assets are easier to verify and retain customers, but they kill our audit timeline and staffing capacity.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Minako,,We cannot afford another company that calls for follow-on capital early. We need something lean and predictable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Mio,,I just don't want another software board seat. We are completely maxed out on that side.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. A ""safe"" software bet might actually be a deployment nightmare if it involves sensitive data.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see the candidates and apply these filters.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Minako,,Let's proceed.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Mio,,Ready!,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's see.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
